          <blockquote>“{review.quote}”</blockquote><strong>{review.name}</strong><span>{review.detail}</span><small>Read the Google Review</small>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="smm-section smm-faq" id="faqs-about-martin">
    <header class="smm-heading"><p class="smm-eyebrow">Questions Martin Owners Ask Me</p><h2>Before You Sell a Vintage Martin</h2><p>You don't need to identify or clean the guitar before contacting me. Send what you know, and I'll help with the rest.</p></header>
